cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  Cite v33 using DOI 10.5281/zenodo.23054568 from the
  beal-conjecture repository. The earlier foundations v25 concept
  DOI 10.5281/zenodo.22379293 is historical, not the v33 DOI.
title: "2-adic even blow-up Tate normal form y^2+xy=x^3+a2x^2+a4x+a6 — three-open gluing v33"
type: software
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.23054568
date-released: '2026-09-30'
authors:
  - family-names: Fox
    given-names: David
version: "v33"
repository-code: "https://github.com/DavidFox998/beal-conjecture"
